$('#analyzeMeal').onclick=async()=>{const file=$('#mealPhoto').files[0];if(!file){$('#scanStatus').textContent=tr('choosePhoto');return}if(!window.Tesseract){$('#scanStatus').textContent=tr('ocrUnavailable');return}const button=$('#analyzeMeal'),progress=$('#scanProgress');button.disabled=true;progress.hidden=false;$('#scanStatus').textContent=tr('readingNutritionLabel');try{const worker=await Tesseract.createWorker('eng',1,{logger:m=>{if(m.status==='recognizing text'){progress.querySelector('span').style.width=`${Math.round((m.progress||0)*100)}%`;$('#scanStatus').textContent=`${tr('readingNutritionLabel')} ${Math.round((m.progress||0)*100)}%`}}});const result=await worker.recognize(file);await worker.terminate();const parsed=parseNutritionText(result.data.text);fillNutritionReview(parsed);$('#scanStatus').textContent=Object.values(parsed).some(v=>v===null)?tr('reviewMissingFields'):tr('labelReadSuccess')}catch(error){$('#scanStatus').textContent=tr('labelReadError')}finally{button.disabled=false;progress.hidden=true;progress.querySelector('span').style.width='0'}};
